HPCPerfStats monitor (hpcperfstatsd)
====================================

This file is a pointer. The package documentation is Markdown:

- README.md: what the package is, how to build and test it, and an index
  of every monitor page under docs/.
- docs/RAW_DATA_FORMAT.md: the on-disk and wire stats format and the
  Python reader in python/hpcperfstats_raw.
- docs/METRICS_REFERENCE.md: every type and key the daemon can emit
  (generated by scripts/gen_metrics_reference.py).
- docs/explanation/x86-counters-and-roofline.md: how the CPU counters,
  uncore, RAPL and roofline peaks are read.
